&lt;li&gt;Share client feedback and market intelligence to shape our product strategy and go-to-market approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and execute our sales vision, contributing to the growth and success of the entire team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
