&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t just about keeping projects on track (though you’ll do plenty of that). In addition to your work with customers, you will serve as a leader within Dscout. You will get experience leading a team and managing people, owning metrics and reporting, and growing your own skillset and experience. If this sounds like you, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
