&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, Research Advisor you will…&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a true Dscout expert &lt;/strong&gt;to assist in running clients’ research projects on Dscout including planning, designing, recruiting, fielding, analysis, and client engagement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
